{"4305550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rockwell's Zen Tiles", "steam_appid": 4305550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A relaxing puzzle journey around the world</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rockwell has spent a lifetime chasing mice, squirrels, and anything else that dared cross his yard.<br>Now? He’s tired. And he’s ready to slow down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rockwell’s Zen Tiles</strong> is a calm, cozy tile-clearing puzzle game about travel, relaxation, and taking things one thoughtful move at a time. Visit beautiful locations around the world, listen to soothing music, and gently clear tiles to help Rockwell unwind and enjoy the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no rush. No timers. Just peaceful puzzles and a dog who’s finally learning how to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How It Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear lines of tiles to advance time and progress through each location.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>one line</strong> to move forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>multiple lines at once</strong> to earn an <strong>Undo</strong>, letting you step back and rethink a move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the <strong>entire board</strong> to earn a special bonus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic play is rewarded, but mistakes are never punished. Zen Tiles is about flow, not pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each country features <strong>five unique locations</strong>, each with its own atmosphere and mood.<br>Clear enough lines to move Rockwell forward in time — and onward to the next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch Rockwell settle in, relax, and enjoy the moment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a journey measured in calm progress, not high scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed to Relax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location pairs gentle visuals with carefully chosen background music.<br>You can mute the music at any time — or let it wash over you while you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game meant to be played:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >after a long day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with a cup of tea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or while your brain quietly unwinds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing tile-clearing puzzle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo rewards for thoughtful multi-line clears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full board clear bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based progression instead of stress or timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit countries and multiple locations around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy visuals and calming soundscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very good dog learning how to rest</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A relaxing puzzle journey around the world</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rockwell has spent a lifetime chasing mice, squirrels, and anything else that dared cross his yard.<br>Now? He’s tired. And he’s ready to slow down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rockwell’s Zen Tiles</strong> is a calm, cozy tile-clearing puzzle game about travel, relaxation, and taking things one thoughtful move at a time. Visit beautiful locations around the world, listen to soothing music, and gently clear tiles to help Rockwell unwind and enjoy the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no rush. No timers. Just peaceful puzzles and a dog who’s finally learning how to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How It Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear lines of tiles to advance time and progress through each location.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>one line</strong> to move forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>multiple lines at once</strong> to earn an <strong>Undo</strong>, letting you step back and rethink a move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the <strong>entire board</strong> to earn a special bonus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic play is rewarded, but mistakes are never punished. Zen Tiles is about flow, not pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each country features <strong>five unique locations</strong>, each with its own atmosphere and mood.<br>Clear enough lines to move Rockwell forward in time — and onward to the next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch Rockwell settle in, relax, and enjoy the moment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a journey measured in calm progress, not high scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed to Relax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location pairs gentle visuals with carefully chosen background music.<br>You can mute the music at any time — or let it wash over you while you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game meant to be played:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >after a long day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with a cup of tea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or while your brain quietly unwinds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing tile-clearing puzzle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo rewards for thoughtful multi-line clears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full board clear bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based progression instead of stress or timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit countries and multiple locations around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy visuals and calming soundscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very good dog learning how to rest</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "After a lifetime of chasing squirrels, Rockwell is ready to relax. Help him unwind in this cozy, tile-clearing puzzle game. Travel the world, clear lines to advance time, earn bonuses, and relax. No timers, no rush — just peaceful puzzles, soothing music, and a very good dog learning to relax.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305550/f8782be355cf30e0d418bcec975fa57664672201/header.jpg?t=1784738838", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305550/3c3f0e55ea69d4164159ac5360abcc4efa9b72e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784738838", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305550/3c3f0e55ea69d4164159ac5360abcc4efa9b72e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784738838", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti 2 GB / AMD Radeon RX 460 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Proc